# RTK (Mandatory)

Prefix terminal commands with `/home/jessec/.local/bin/rtk` whenever RTK supports the tool. Bypasses GUI env limits and cuts token use.

**Always prefix:** `cargo` (build/check/test/clippy), `git` (status/diff/log), `grep`/`rg`, `find`, `diff`, `ls`/`tree`.

**Do not prefix:** `mkdir`, `touch`, `chmod`, `cd`, heredocs, `python3 -c`, MCP calls, or anything RTK has no proxy for.

Default to `rtk` on every Shell call. If it fails, retry once without `rtk` for diagnostics, then report both outcomes.
